Condition : 9 - No development above ground level shall take place until details of all materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.
The details shall include:
a) Window and door treatments (including sections/reveals);
b) Balcony details (including soffits, panels and frame);
c) All privacy measures (including obscure glazing details, privacy screens, guttering, etc.);
The development shall then be carried out in accordance with the approved details and the hereby approved External Materials Schedule and maintained as such thereafter.
